#   no-agents-md / no-rules-block   sync-agent-rules.mjs opens the pull request
#   claude-md-not-a-pointer         fold what is still true into AGENTS.md, leave the pointer
#   home-claude-import-in-*         a rule that lives only on one person's machine is not the repo's
